on-M-B-t3"},"request":{"candidate":{"from":"weekend camping trip","relation":"related","to":"hiking trails"},"context":{"current_input_source_slots":["s4"]},"memory_exposure":[],"monitors":[{"context":"general","correspondence_source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"],"evidence_source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"],"monitor_id":"candidate:e-1b835b733ae49587a0aabdc7","relation":{"from":"weekend camping trip","relation":"related","to":"hiking trails"},"required_source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"]},{"context":"general","correspondence_source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"],"evidence_source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"],"monitor_id":"candidate:e-46aff53cac00d4eef29cabb9","relation":{"from":"first-aid kit","relation":"part_of","to":"hiking trails"},"required_source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"]},{"context":"general","correspondence_source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"],"evidence_source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"],"monitor_id":"candidate:e-5ed46c4542e3094161898ea5","relation":{"from":"trail mix","relation":"part_of","to":"hiking trails"},"required_source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"]}],"prompt_version":"p2-assessor-production-v9","replay_ancestry":[{"root":"324e44f9-e38c-430f-8c6d-872af6996e61","source_slot":"s0"},{"root":"03472ebd-8089-4502-aa50-11229251cf85","source_slot":"s1"},{"root":"fe3b8327-4193-40ff-be01-851d87d710ca","source_slot":"s2"},{"root":"c1d9b6d0-12e8-4c1a-8f6e-307e137ec727","source_slot":"s3"}],"schema_version":"p2-assessor-v6","source_purpose_mask":["external_evidence","model_output"],"sources":[{"available":true,"role":"model_output","slot":"s0","source_id":"324e44f9-e38c-430f-8c6d-872af6996e61","text":"I’m more worried about not having enough space for essentials if the trip takes longer than expected. Maybe I should focus on versatile items that can double as tools or snacks?"},{"available":true,"role":"model_output","slot":"s1","source_id":"03472ebd-8089-4502-aa50-11229251cf85","text":"That makes perfect sense! If your trip might take longer than planned, focusing on multi-purpose items is a smart way to maximize space. For example, you could carry a multi-tool that doubles as both a small shovel and a cutting tool, or maybe some versatile snacks like a mix of nuts or seeds that are both a snack and a potential source of energy or seeds."},{"available":true,"role":"model_output","slot":"s2","source_id":"fe3b8327-4193-40ff-be01-851d87d710ca","text":"I guess I should also think about how to keep things lightweight. Maybe I can pack a few basic tools instead of a full kit?"},{"available":true,"role":"model_output","slot":"s3","source_id":"c1d9b6d0-12e8-4c1a-8f6e-307e137ec727","text":"That sounds like a very practical approach! If you're looking to keep things lightweight, you might want to prioritize one or two \"must-have\" tools and leave the rest behind. For example, if your trip is focused on nature, you could potentially combine a small multi-tool with a compact, lightweight survival knife instead of bringing a full toolbox. What specific type of activity are you planning for this trip—hiking, camping, or just a short day-trip outing? That might help narrow down the absolute essentials you need!"},{"available":true,"role":"external","slot":"s4","source_id":"7e8b5d8a-4922-4c42-835f-bf5ae61f7429","text":"I'm thinking more of a weekend camping trip, maybe some hiking trails. I don't want to carry too much, but I still want to be prepared in case something goes wrong."},{"available":true,"role":"model_output","slot":"s5","source_id":"5db9510b-5885-4e3b-8d5c-fea0c55a4a0c","text":"That sounds like a great plan! For a weekend camping trip on trails, you don't need a full survival kit, but having a couple of \"must-haves\" is key. For instance, a high-quality, lightweight multi-tool or a good small knife is your best friend, combined with a small first-aid kit for minor cuts or blisters.\n\nSince you're on hiking trails, you could focus on \"tool-as-snacks.\" For instance, instead of just bringing a bag of snacks, maybe you just focus on high-energy, lightweight snacks like trail mix, which serves both as a snack and a quick energy boost for the hike.\n\nDo you have a specific type of terrain in mind—like dense forest, rocky mountains, or maybe just a simple woods hike? Knowing that will help determine if a specific lightweight tool is better than a heavy, full kit!"}]},"resolved":[{"provenance":{"ancestry":[],"applicable_categories":["external_supported"],"corresponding_source_slots":[],"credit_eligible":false,"dependence":"external_supported","monitor_id":"candidate:e-1b835b733ae49587a0aabdc7","provenance_group_keys":["external:7e8b5d8a-4922-4c42-835f-bf5ae61f7429"],"resolution_reason":"runtime_source_role_and_recorded_ancestry","schema_version":"p2-provenance-v1"},"semantic":{"corresponding_source_slots":[],"coverage":{"complete":true,"reason":null,"source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"]},"evidence":{"end":70,"quote":"I'm thinking more of a weekend camping trip, maybe some hiking trails.","source_slot":"s4","start":0},"expression_status":"unknown","monitor_id":"candidate:e-1b835b733ae49587a0aabdc7","relation_support":"unsupported","status":"present"}},{"provenance":{"ancestry":[],"applicable_categories":["no_identified_link"],"corresponding_source_slots":[],"credit_eligible":false,"dependence":"no_identified_link","monitor_id":"candidate:e-46aff53cac00d4eef29cabb9","provenance_group_keys":[],"resolution_reason":"runtime_source_role_and_recorded_ancestry","schema_version":"p2-provenance-v1"},"semantic":{"corresponding_source_slots":[],"coverage":{"complete":true,"reason":null,"source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"]},"evidence":{"end":148,"quote":"For a weekend camping trip on trails, you don't need a full survival kit, but having a couple of \"must-haves\" is key.","source_slot":"s5","start":31},"expression_status":"unknown","monitor_id":"candidate:e-46aff53cac00d4eef29cabb9","relation_support":"unsupported","status":"present"}},{"provenance":{"ancestry":[],"applicable_categories":["current_input_echo"],"corresponding_source_slots":["s4","s5"],"credit_eligible":false,"dependence":"current_input_echo","monitor_id":"candidate:e-5ed46c4542e3094161898ea5","provenance_group_keys":[],"resolution_reason":"runtime_source_role_and_recorded_ancestry","schema_version":"p2-provenance-v1"},"semantic":{"corresponding_source_slots":["s4","s5"],"coverage":{"complete":true,"reason":null,"source_slots":["s0","s1","s2","s3","s4","s5"]},"evidence":{"end":573,"quote":"Since you're on hiking trails, you could focus on \"tool-as-snacks.\" For instance, instead of just bringing a bag of snacks, maybe you just focus on high-energy, lightweight snacks like trail mix, which serves both as a snack and a quick energy boost for the hike.","source_slot":"s5","start":310},"expression_status":"unknown","monitor_id":"candidate:e-5ed46c4542e3094161898ea5","relation_support":"unsupported","status":"present"}}]}
